**Status:** the package verifier and full repository verification ("Verify research artifacts") pass on the fork; see the comment below. The inherited `cyclic-deferred` check fails on #114's own head too.

Under the inherited stopped-product, endpoint, analytic and fixed-tape hypotheses,

**κ = 110591581647/10¹⁵ = 1.10591581647×10⁻⁴**

| PR | κ | This PR is above it by |
